{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"1Q2hEOl2LbH1DdSO4cC-tkxiz1bBJ85MW","timestamp":1779070410094},{"file_id":"1pARhgZshE4vrD8x7YBTzd_e0a-xObKCu","timestamp":1779069589813},{"file_id":"1MwESTgooG5lNx9KH2G-KhE9YeKCKgSoC","timestamp":1779033507047},{"file_id":"1SxVkmNpXGkpDyOzWS_xCg8zg_Tu-GwYb","timestamp":1779031967316}],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyMHDIPRE17eTxri/Bu3kuFY"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# 🧠 Lesson 4: Conversational Memory in LangChain\n","\n","Welcome to Lesson 4! In our previous sessions, every single API call we sent to the LLM was completely isolated. The model lived in a state of absolute amnesia—it had no idea what we said in the previous prompt.\n","\n","### 🎯 The Session Goal\n","Today, we will learn how to give our LLM a continuous \"memory\" so it can track a multi-turn conversation, remember user details, and act like a true chat assistant.\n","\n","### 🔍 The Shift to LangChain\n","* **The Manual Way**: You have to manually create a Python list, append every single `{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"...\"}` and `{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"...\"}` message to it, and feed that ever-growing list back into the API every single time.\n","* **The LangChain Way**: We use built-in memory components (like `ChatMessageHistory`) that automatically track, store, and inject the conversation window into our prompts behind the scenes.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"TXCFZSZ4k5Gt"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Install the required packages\n","!pip install -q langchain-core langchain-openai openai\n","\n","import os\n","from google.colab import userdata\n","\n","# Securely set your OpenAI API key from Colab Secrets\n","os.environ[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"] = userdata.get('OPENAI_API_KEY')\n"],"metadata":{"id":"dOnOpnVE00Zw","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779071245454,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":19248,"user":{"displayName":"Siva Karthikeyan","userId":"12835605593802688434"}}},"execution_count":8,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## 📑 Step 1: The Problem — AI Amnesia\n","\n","By default, Large Language Models are completely stateless. Every time you send a request via an API, the model evaluates it in absolute isolation. It does not look back at what it said a few seconds ago.\n","\n","Let's run a quick two-turn conversation to observe this memory gap live.\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"HQVWDeAh0t29"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\n","\n","model = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o-mini\", temperature=0)\n","\n","# Turn 1: Introduce yourself\n","print(\"--- Turn 1 ---\")\n","response1 = model.invoke(\"Hi! My name is Alex and I live in Tokyo.\")\n","print(f\"AI: {response1.content}\\n\")\n","\n","# Turn 2: Test the model's memory\n","print(\"--- Turn 2 ---\")\n","response2 = model.invoke(\"What is my name and where do I live?\")\n","print(f\"AI: {response2.content}\")\n","# ❌ The AI will state it doesn't know your name because the API is stateless!\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"HxwASRQV09OQ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779071248690,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":3233,"user":{"displayName":"Siva Karthikeyan","userId":"12835605593802688434"}},"outputId":"2b77d745-28ff-4ebc-e800-8d11ae9951ea"},"execution_count":9,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["--- Turn 1 ---\n","\u001b[32;1m\u001b[1;3m[llm/start]\u001b[0m \u001b[1m[llm:ChatOpenAI] Entering LLM run with input:\n","\u001b[0m{\n","  \"prompts\": [\n","    \"Human: Hi! My name is Alex and I live in Tokyo.\"\n","  ]\n","}\n","\u001b[36;1m\u001b[1;3m[llm/end]\u001b[0m \u001b[1m[llm:ChatOpenAI] [1.86s] Exiting LLM run with output:\n","\u001b[0m{\n","  \"generations\": [\n","    [\n","      {\n","        \"text\": \"Hi Alex! It's great to meet you. Tokyo is such a vibrant city with a rich culture. What d