rse of our conversation. I am designed to respect user privacy and confidentiality. How can I assist you today?\",\n","        \"generation_info\": {\n","          \"finish_reason\": \"stop\",\n","          \"logprobs\": null\n","        },\n","        \"type\": \"ChatGeneration\",\n","        \"message\": {\n","          \"lc\": 1,\n","          \"type\": \"constructor\",\n","          \"id\": [\n","            \"langchain\",\n","            \"schema\",\n","            \"messages\",\n","            \"AIMessage\"\n","          ],\n","          \"kwargs\": {\n","            \"content\": \"I'm sorry, but I don't have access to personal information about individuals unless it has been shared with me in the course of our conversation. I am designed to respect user privacy and confidentiality. How can I assist you today?\",\n","            \"additional_kwargs\": {\n","              \"refusal\": null\n","            },\n","            \"response_metadata\": {\n","              \"token_usage\": {\n","                \"completion_tokens\": 44,\n","                \"prompt_tokens\": 17,\n","                \"total_tokens\": 61,\n","                \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n","                  \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\n","                  \"audio_tokens\": 0,\n","                  \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\n","                  \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\n","                },\n","                \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n","                  \"audio_tokens\": 0,\n","                  \"cached_tokens\": 0\n","                }\n","              },\n","              \"model_provider\": \"openai\",\n","              \"model_name\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\n","              \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_46ecd5c680\",\n","              \"id\": \"chatcmpl-DghzT4YaCyqgUjcUTUTUWyJ3RHc4O\",\n","              \"service_tier\": \"default\",\n","              \"finish_reason\": \"stop\",\n","              \"logprobs\": null\n","            },\n","            \"type\": \"ai\",\n","            \"id\": \"lc_run--019e38e8-e3d6-75d2-9818-87d5456c002a-0\",\n","            \"usage_metadata\": {\n","              \"input_tokens\": 17,\n","              \"output_tokens\": 44,\n","              \"total_tokens\": 61,\n","              \"input_token_details\": {\n","                \"audio\": 0,\n","                \"cache_read\": 0\n","              },\n","              \"output_token_details\": {\n","                \"audio\": 0,\n","                \"reasoning\": 0\n","              }\n","            },\n","            \"tool_calls\": [],\n","            \"invalid_tool_calls\": []\n","          }\n","        }\n","      }\n","    ]\n","  ],\n","  \"llm_output\": {\n","    \"token_usage\": {\n","      \"completion_tokens\": 44,\n","      \"prompt_tokens\": 17,\n","      \"total_tokens\": 61,\n","      \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n","        \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\n","        \"audio_tokens\": 0,\n","        \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\n","        \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\n","      },\n","      \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n","        \"audio_tokens\": 0,\n","        \"cached_tokens\": 0\n","      }\n","    },\n","    \"model_provider\": \"openai\",\n","    \"model_name\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\n","    \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_46ecd5c680\",\n","    \"id\": \"chatcmpl-DghzT4YaCyqgUjcUTUTUWyJ3RHc4O\",\n","    \"service_tier\": \"default\"\n","  },\n","  \"run\": null,\n","  \"type\": \"LLMResult\"\n","}\n","AI: I'm sorry, but I don't have access to personal information about individuals unless it has been shared with me in the course of our conversation. I am designed to respect user privacy and confidentiality. How can I assist you today?\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["---\n","\n","## 📑 Step 2: The Solution — LangChain Message History\n","\n","To fix this, we could write complex Python code to manually append our conversations into a custom array. Instead, LangChain provides a structured pipeline to handle this data overhead automatically.\n","\n","We will use:\n","1. **`MessagesPlaceholder`**: A dynamic slot inside our prompt template where the chat history will be automatically injected.\n","2. **`RunnableWithMessageHistory`**: A structural wrapper that intercepts user inputs, grabs historical logs from memory, appends them to the prompt, and pipes them directly to the LLM.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"-Yttyyi71Wmn"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from langchain_core.chat_history import InMemoryChatMessageHistory\n","from langchain_core.runnables.history import RunnableWithMessageHistory\n","from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate, MessagesPlaceholder\n","from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\n","# 🌟 Import the global configuration tracking tools\n","from langchain_core.globals import set_debug\n","\n","# 🌟 Enable global debugging to visually trace the pipeline execution steps\n","set_debug(False)\n","\n","# 1. Create a prompt template that leaves a slot for chat history\n","prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\n","    (\"system\", \"You are a helpful assistant.\"),\n","    MessagesPlaceholder(variable_name=\"chat_history\"), # Memory gets injected here!\n","    (\"human\", \"{input}\")\n","])\n","\n","model = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o-mini\", temperature=0)\n","chain = prompt | model\n","\n","# 2. Set up a dictionary to hold session histories in memory\n","store = {}\n","\n","def get_session_history(session_id: str):\n","    if session_id not in store:\n","        store[session_id] = InMemoryChatMessageHistory()\n","    return store[session_id]\n","\n","# 3. Wrap our chain with automatic message history tracking\n","with_message_history = RunnableWithMessageHistory(\n","    chain,\n","    get_session_history,\n","    input_messages_key=\"input\",\n","    history_messages_key=\"chat_history\"\n",")\n","\n","# 4. Run a multi-turn conversation using a unique session ID\n","config = {\"configurable\": {\"session_id\": \"session_alex_123\"}}\n","\n","print(\"--- Turn 1 (With LangChain Memory) ---\")\n","res1 = with_message_history.invoke({\"input\": \"Hi! My name is Alex and I live in Tokyo.\"}, config=config)\n","print(f\"AI: {res1.content}\\n\")\n","\n","print(\"--- Turn 2 (With LangChain Memory) ---\")\n","res2 = with_message_history.invoke({\"input\": \"What is my name and where do I live?\"}, config=config)\n","print(f\"AI: {res2.content}\")\n","#  The AI remembers! Output: \"Your name is Alex and you live in Tokyo.\"\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"1Xr3Zz2x1h6k","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779071374649,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":1805,"user":{"displayName":"Siva Karthikeyan","userId":"12835605593802688434"}},"outputId":"56d821ce-333f-4333-f211-d082c10c591e","collapsed":true},"execution_count":11,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["--- Turn 1 (With LangChain Memory) ---\n","AI: Hi Alex! It's great to meet you. Tokyo is such a vibrant city with a rich culture and so much to explore. What do you enjoy most about living there?\n","\n","--- Turn 2 (With LangChain Memory) ---\n","AI: Your name is Alex, and you live in Tokyo.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## 📑 Step 3: Inspecting Memory Internals — Variables & Values\n","\n","Let's look behind the curtain. We know that `RunnableWithMessageHistory` works by checking our `store` dictionary using a `session_id`.\n","\n","Let's inspect exactly what **variables** are created, what **data type** they use, and exactly **what text content** LangChain holds in memory for our active session.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"zrILpkzG6vvh"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 1. Access the raw session container directly from our data store\n","session_history = store[\"session_alex_123\"]\n","\n","print(\"--- 🔍 1. Understanding the Variable and Types ---\")\n","print(f\"Active Store Key: 'session_alex_123'\")\n","print(f\"Memory Object Type: {type(session_history)}\")\n","print(f\"Internal Messages Variable Type: {type(session_history.messages)}\\n\")\n","\n","print(\"--- 📜 2. What the Memory Array Holds (Raw Objects) ---\")\n","# LangChain stores history as a clean Python list of specialized Message objects\n","for idx, message in enumerate(session_history.messages):\n","    print(f\"Message [{idx}] Type: {type(message).__name__}\")\n","    print(f\"           Content: \\\"{message.content}\\\"\")\n","    print(f\"           Metadata: {getattr(message, 'response_metadata', {}) if hasattr(message, 'response_metadata') else 'None'}\\n\")\n","\n","print(\"--- 🚀 3. How the Prompt Template Reads This Data ---\")\n","# This is exactly what get injected directly into the {chat_history} slot\n","print(session_history.messages)\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"icd8Uo_g6uW6","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779071400617,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":28,"user":{"displayName":"Siva Karthikeyan","userId":"12835605593802688434"}},"outputId":"6708531e-46a1-49a8-f7c8-389936bcbcd0"},"execution_count":12,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["--- 🔍 1. Understanding the Variable and Types ---\n","Active Store Key: 'session_alex_123'\n","Memory Object Type: <class 'langchain_core.chat_history.InMemoryChatMessageHistory'>\n","Internal Messages Variable Type: <class 'list'>\n","\n","--- 📜 2. What the Memory Array Holds (Raw Objects) ---\n","Message [0] Type: HumanMessage\n","           Content: \"Hi! My name is Alex and I live in Tokyo.\"\n","           Metadata: {}\n","\n","Message [1] Type: AIMessage\n","           Content: \"Hi Alex! It's great to meet you. Tokyo is such a vibrant city with a rich culture and so much to explore. What do you enjoy most about living there?\"\n","           Metadata: {'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 34, 'prompt_tokens': 29, 'total_tokens': 63, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': 0, 'audio_tokens': 0, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': 0}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}}, 'model_provider': 'openai', 'model_name': 'gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18', 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_4c26bdd887', 'id': 'chatcmpl-Dgi1VJ9eUOzdvpaeN2m9AeuZo4ZgN', 'service_tier': 'default', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None}\n","\n","Message [2] Type: HumanMessage\n","           Content: \"What is my name and where do I live?\"\n","           Metadata: {}\n","\n","Message [3] Type: AIMessage\n","           Content: \"Your name is Alex, and you live in Tokyo.\"\n","           Metadata: {'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 11, 'prompt_tokens': 81, 'total_tokens': 92, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': 0, 'audio_tokens': 0, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': 0}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}}, 'model_provider': 'openai', 'model_name': 'gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18', 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_ac7a1e4bb7', 'id': 'chatcmpl-Dgi1WAJHSZKTHVxqbrdfyk2889ZCJ', 'service_tier': 'default', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None}\n","\n","--- 🚀 3. How the Prompt Template Reads This Data ---\n","[HumanMessage(content='Hi! My name is Alex and I live in Tokyo.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content=\"Hi Alex! It's great to meet you. Tokyo is such a vibrant city with a rich culture and so much to explore. What do you enjoy most about living there?\", additional_kwargs={'refusal': None}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 34, 'prompt_tokens': 29, 'total_tokens': 63, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': 0, 'audio_tokens': 0, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': 0}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}}, 'model_provider': 'openai', 'model_name': 'gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18', 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_4c26bdd887', 'id': 'chatcmpl-Dgi1VJ9eUOzdvpaeN2m9AeuZo4ZgN', 'service_tier': 'default', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None}, id='lc_run--019e38ea-ce39-7ec0-ac52-5baf35ab8492-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 29, 'output_tokens': 34, 'total_tokens': 63, 'input_token_details': {'audio': 0, 'cache_read': 0}, 'output_token_details': {'audio': 0, 'reasoning': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='What is my name and where do I live?', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content='Your name is Alex, and you live in Tokyo.', additional_kwargs={'refusal': None}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 11, 'prompt_tokens': 81, 'total_tokens': 92, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': 0, 'audio_tokens': 0, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': 0}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}}, 'model_provider': 'openai', 'model_name': 'gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18', 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_ac7a1e4bb7', 'id': 'chatcmpl-Dgi1WAJHSZKTHVxqbrdfyk2889ZCJ', 'service_tier': 'default', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None}, id='lc_run--019e38ea-d37a-7ef2-bb7e-5ac237749b4e-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 81, 'output_tokens': 11, 'total_tokens': 92, 'input_token_details': {'audio': 0, 'cache_read': 0}, 'output_token_details': {'audio': 0, 'reasoning': 0}})]\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 💡 Core Takeaways from the Variables Inspection:\n","1. **Object-Oriented History**: LangChain doesn't store simple strings. It maps transactions to formal **`HumanMessage`** and **`AIMessage`** class objects.\n","2. **Metadata Capture**: If you look closely at the `AIMessage` parameters, LangChain preserves the underlying backend tokens, model names, and finish reasons sent by OpenAI.\n","3. **The `MessagesPlaceholder` Target**: When our LCEL chain triggers, it passes this entire Python list directly down to our prompt template. The prompt translates these typed message objects into the exact structure required by the target model provider's API endpoint (e.g., standard API role definitions).\n"],"metadata":{"id":"6zm-vbb-7Bem"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## 🏁 Lesson 4 Conclusion: The Big Takeaway\n","\n","By wrapping our processing chain inside `RunnableWithMessageHistory`, we completely removed the manual labor of maintaining an array of chat messages.\n","\n","### 💡 Keys concepts taught today:\n","1. **Stateless APIs**: LLMs do not inherently remember anything between independent API hits.\n","2. **MessagesPlaceholder**: A target token inside your prompt layout that dynamically scales to fit past conversation context.\n","3. **Session IDs**: By utilizing `session_id`, LangChain allows a single backend server to isolate and manage memory streams for millions of completely unique users simultaneously.\n","\n","### 🌟 Previewing Lesson 5:\n","Now that our agent can **call tools (Lesson 2)**, **parse structured data (Lesson 3)**, and **remember context (Lesson 4)**, we have all the building blocks to learn about **Chains** in our next session!\n"],"metadata":{"id":"Ae-Mzxo-2ESJ"}}]}